{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40009,"sections":[{"id":"script-20009","name":"原始脚本 20009","scripts":[20009],"start":0,"count":30}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:1","scriptId":20009,"text":"周边的战车兽基本都已经化作数据链消失在了扎莉等人的视线之中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":633,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:2","scriptId":20009,"text":"“差不多完事了。波西娅，听到了没？波西娅！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":633,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:3","scriptId":20009,"text":"虽然扎莉呼喊了波西娅的名字，但是波西娅这次并没有瞬间出现在她们面前。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":633,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:4","scriptId":20009,"text":"“不会去上厕所了吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":633,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":698,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:5","scriptId":20009,"text":"“不排除这种可能，但是我觉得也可能是发生了突发事件。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":698,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:6","scriptId":20009,"text":"正当黑色闪电小队的一行人无所事事，等待下一步的命令时，波西娅终于出现了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":698,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:7","scriptId":20009,"text":"“恩，干得不错，你们这里数据已经完全记录到了数据库中，不过现在有个问题……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":698,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":638,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:8","scriptId":20009,"text":"“什么问题，尽管说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":638,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:9","scriptId":20009,"text":"“刚才有不明信号携带一批数据入侵到了这个模拟世界中，帮我把这些病毒数据去清理掉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":638,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:10","scriptId":20009,"text":"“完全没有问题，这点小事，不过这病毒数据长什么样？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:11","scriptId":20009,"text":"“我会把你们传到那些数据附近，接下来就看你们的了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:12","scriptId":20009,"text":"“也好，反正一般的战车兽数据也没什么意思，模式太老套，都不觉得有什么新鲜感，除了死亡的时候会变成数据链这一点挺好玩的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":535,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:13","scriptId":20009,"text":"“不要妄下判断，说不定是很麻烦的事情，毕竟波西娅博士这种专家都处理不了啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":535,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:14","scriptId":20009,"text":"“啊……其实也不是处理不了啊，只不过是如果由你们去处理的话，我这边可以把病毒的数据都统计下来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":608,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":697,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:15","scriptId":20009,"text":"“原来是这个意思啊……我懂了，没有异议。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":608,"right":697,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:16","scriptId":20009,"text":"“那么就这样，出发吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":608,"right":697,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:17","scriptId":20009,"text":"波西娅高兴地点点头，接下来她打了一个响指～","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":608,"right":697,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:19","scriptId":20009,"text":"扎莉等人突然觉得一阵头晕，有数据不断从眼前划过，在一连串的天旋地转以后，突然眼前一亮。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:21","scriptId":20009,"text":"看来是传送完毕了，这时扎莉都不知道自己是不是站着的……她感觉到自己靠在一堵墙上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:22","scriptId":20009,"text":"过了两秒左右，她终于反应过来了，那不是墙，而是地面，因为传送完毕以后自己从站姿变成了平躺在地上，所以体感一下子没跟上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":642,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:23","scriptId":20009,"text":"“这种体验真是奇妙……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":642,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:24","scriptId":20009,"text":"“我看还是算了吧……我的头又晕又疼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":642,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":697,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:25","scriptId":20009,"text":"“弄眼镜上都是灰……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":697,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:26","scriptId":20009,"text":"“那个我想就是目标了吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":697,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:27","scriptId":20009,"text":"扎莉伸手指向一点钟方向，那里正有一团团像软泥一样的东西。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":697,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":63,"speaker":"原核体-混乱","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:28","scriptId":20009,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":63,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:29","scriptId":20009,"text":"“和这个战斗不会弄脏衣服吧……那个粘液我可不想沾上……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":535,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:30","scriptId":20009,"text":"“弄脏了也只不过是数据而已，不用太在意。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":535,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:31","scriptId":20009,"text":"“但是感觉一定不好。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":535,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":698,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20009:20009:32","scriptId":20009,"text":"“那就用你的履带好好想想怎么闪避吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":535,"right":698,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
